{"lyrics":"[00:00.62](CHASETHEMONEY, CHASETHEMONEY)\n[00:04.94]Chase\n[00:05.06]Uhh, grrt, bih, bih, grrt\n[00:06.12]Uhh, hey (Oh, oh)\n[00:09.90]Yeah\n[00:11.08]It's motherfuck what you say, I'm on my way\n[00:14.42]Uh, swervin' in the Wraith, on the way to the bank\n[00:17.22]Uh, let it go bang, if he in the way\n[00:20.22]Uh, hit him in his brain, bullet through his face, uh\n[00:23.58]I ain't wanna do it, but I had to (Uh-uh)\n[00:26.48]Won't go let a fuck nigga fuck up my day\n[00:29.14]I'm a rich nigga, so I make 'em mad (Yeah), so mad\n[00:31.96]I hopped in a Wraith then race to the bank (Skrrt)\n[00:35.62]I gotta race, keep the millions in the safe, okay (Okay)\n[00:38.30]Ain't nobody ever take my cash away, no way (Way)\n[00:41.50]I done came up, got rich for the whole gang\n[00:44.60]I done made my own name, look like I'm sellin' cocaine\n[00:47.34]Swerving in the new thang\n[00:49.46]It look like a dragon from the Yu-Gi-Oh game\n[00:52.30]Ballin' like I'm Magic, why they got no game?\n[00:55.64]I'm on my way, came a long way from freestylin' in my driveway\n[00:59.50]Remember playing music in the car on the highway\n[01:02.52]Headphones in while my dear mama drivin'\n[01:05.42]Still don't got a license, I been supermoto slidin'\n[01:08.44]Through the Cali hills, mesmerized at the horizon\n[01:11.40]Yeah, my connection gang, on Verizon\n[01:14.32]Yeah, boolin' with the gang on an island\n[01:17.28]Next might be Thailand\n[01:18.80]Ain't no tellin' when my money pilin' and pilin' and pilin' and pilin'\n[01:23.14]I remember Impalas\n[01:24.54]I remember bein' broke, and I ain't have a dollar\n[01:27.28]Got robbed by some niggas in a blue Monte Carlo\n[01:30.14]Gang-gang was on they ass the next day, that followed\n[01:33.50]Yeah, I'm rich now, but I done been through some sorrows\n[01:36.02]Remember we was broke as hell, money what we had to borrow\n[01:39.06]\"I can't pay ya' right now, can I pay you back tomorrow?\"\n[01:42.34]Rent due, bills due, lien cars, we used\n[01:45.32]That's when God came through\n[01:46.52]Now mom don't gotta work, ooh, put Birkin on the purse, ooh\n[01:49.66]Momma, I love you, got a crib for you\n[01:52.62]Diamonds on my girl too, Lotti is my world, ooh\n[01:55.62]Her name my tattoo, all this shit I've been through\n[01:58.42]Then I became a rich dude, then I finally found you\n[02:01.30]Don't matter how much money I make, your love, it can't amount to\n[02:08.02]Priceless, girl your love priceless\n[02:20.54]My life is priceless, so for it, I'll leave you lifeless (Oh)\n[02:26.48]Yeah, priceless, girl your love priceless\n[02:29.82]My life is priceless, so for it, I'll leave you lifeless\n[03:00.78]Uh, gang, gang, gang\n[03:01.46]CHASETHEMONEY,CHASETHEMONEY\n[03:02.58]When it's rainy, when it's sunny\n[03:04.04]Fuck these niggas, gon' do nothin'\n[03:05.70]Brr, go, go, go, go, go, uh, go, go, go\n[03:07.36]Fromunda\n[03:07.98]I hate you\n[03:08.54]I fucking—","words":[[0.62,1.74,"(CHASETHEMONEY,"],[1.78,4.9,"CHASETHEMONEY)"],[4.94,5.02,"Chase"],[5.06,5.12,"Uhh,"],[5.16,5.26,"grrt,"],[5.8,5.84,"bih,"],[5.9,5.94,"bih,"],[6.0,6.08,"grrt"],[6.12,6.28,"Uhh,"],[6.32,6.36,"hey"],[6.42,8.1,"(Oh,"],[8.22,8.54,"oh)"],[9.9,10.1,"Yeah"],[11.08,11.24,"It's"],[11.36,12.0,"motherfuck"],[12.1,12.22,"what"],[12.28,12.34,"you"],[12.48,12.72,"say,"],[13.16,13.22,"I'm"],[13.32,13.46,"on"],[13.58,13.8,"my"],[13.94,14.28,"way"],[14.42,14.48,"Uh,"],[14.6,15.08,"swervin'"],[15.14,15.18,"in"],[15.22,15.28,"the"],[15.4,15.78,"Wraith,"],[15.88,15.96,"on"],[16.0,16.04,"the"],[16.18,16.4,"way"],[16.54,16.62,"to"],[16.7,16.76,"the"],[16.92,17.18,"bank"],[17.22,17.26,"Uh,"],[17.64,17.8,"let"],[17.86,17.92,"it"],[18.0,18.06,"go"],[18.36,19.1,"bang,"],[19.16,19.26,"if"],[19.3,19.34,"he"],[19.44,19.46,"in"],[19.54,19.58,"the"],[19.86,20.18,"way"],[20.22,20.32,"Uh,"],[20.58,20.74,"hit"],[20.78,20.92,"him"],[20.96,21.04,"in"],[21.08,21.18,"his"],[21.3,21.96,"brain,"],[22.06,22.3,"bullet"],[22.4,22.56,"through"],[22.6,22.64,